{"id":824884,"title":"09｜智能体和开发工具的区别","content":"智能体与工具在功能和特性上存在显著差异。首先，工具执行任务时是被动的，需要用户主动输入指令才能得到结果，而智能体能够自主完成任务，如自动计算股票涨跌幅。其次，工具通常处理单一任务，智能体则能整合多个复杂任务，例如结合路况信息做出驾驶决策。此外，工具的交互模式为单向，即一次输入对应一次输出；相比之下，智能体支持多轮对话，提供更丰富的交互体验。智能体间可以互相协作，共同完成任务，而工具之间无法直接互动。更重要的是，智能体具备自我进化的能力，通过不断学习优化性能，最终实现端到端的自动化改进，工具则不具备这种能力。最后，智能体往往依赖于大模型来增强其功能，而工具不涉及此类高级技术。综上所述，智能体不仅更加灵活、高效，而且能够模拟人类决策过程，展现出比传统工具更大的应用潜力。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":396261,"user_name":"see  you","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2585760,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"DD7C14CB79DC64","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/27/74/a0/e9cd5d3c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1733801478,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100839601,"comment_content":"看完还是不知道咋么开发Agent？请问老师咋么从零基础开始。","like_count":5,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":4451010,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/43/ea/c2/2124e050.jpg","nickname":"白泽","note":"","ucode":"10082F92FA8394","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":676332,"discussion_content":"先理解这些概念 就算入门了","content_length":37,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1767111077,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"重庆","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397364,"user_name":"渣渣左","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1248863,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"ACEB73277346CC","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83equXYHzYnWw7vLxnnVh0wQCdMoDroVfJpicVZ1cA3MTaBuTRvlCzI3c0ou1ia9tsgr00Fjg5ljFweQQ/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1737962093,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100839601,"comment